{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/pulls/21","id":4553846036,"node_id":"PR_kwDOULzL-M8AAAABD24tFA","html_url":"https://github.com/321Team/infra-ansible/pull/21","diff_url":"https://github.com/321Team/infra-ansible/pull/21.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/321Team/infra-ansible/pull/21.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/issues/21","number":21,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[TEST ONLY / DO NOT MERGE] Issue #5 격리 Actions count 결함 탐지","user":{"login":"GWONUK","id":277643063,"node_id":"U_kgDOEIx_Nw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/277643063?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK","html_url":"https://github.com/GWONUK","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GWONUK/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 목적\nIssue #5의 실제 GitHub Actions 고의 결함 탐지 인수용 임시 PR입니다. **main에 병합하지 않습니다.**\n\n정상 시험 PR #20의 고정 source `2750634766862d7fe19479acacc4259ee8315061`에서 분기했으며, 정상 Attempt2 인수 완료 후 승인된 `intentional-count-defect.patch`와 동일한 **한 줄 결함만** 추가했습니다.\n\n## 고의 결함\n`playbooks/harden_svc_ansible_key.yml`의 첫 managed-key count guard:\n\n```diff\n- or (p1_managed_key_count.stdout | int) != 1\n+ or (p1_managed_key_count.stdout | int) != 2\n```\n\n정상 source 대비 HEAD `c50a6b3316fabba08d5211933e3733f8026e2d95`는 1 commit ahead이며 변경 파일 1개, +1/-1뿐입니다. 원격/운영 SSH·apply를 수행하는 결함이 아니라 localhost fixture에서 CI fail-closed 탐지를 검증합니다.\n\n## 기대 결과\n- 고정 격리 Runner selector: `self-hosted,Linux,X64,fds-ci,ansible-isolated`\n- exact HEAD checkout\n- syntax 단계 자체는 통과 가능하지만 fixture/guard 단계가 이 결함을 탐지해야 함\n- Job/Check는 **failure**여야 하며, `CI_RESULT.status=FAIL`과 원본 artifact가 보존되어야 함\n- queued/skipped/환경 오류/Runner 실패는 **결함 탐지 PASS로 간주하지 않음**\n- Runner session 종료 후 container/proxy/workspace 및 GitHub 등록 ID/name 부재를 별도 인수\n\n## 선행 정상 시험\nRun `35139314896` Attempt2 / Job·Check `104963520513`는 success. Runner ID5 Runtime, IPC isolation18/18, local cleanup, 관리 API 부재, Artifact10470072587 원본 SHA256 및 내부 manifest/CI_RESULT/fixture 원문을 후속 receipt에서 검증했습니다.\n\n관련: #5, PR #17, #19, #20, `fds-project-evidence#13`.\n\n**TEST ONLY / DO NOT MERGE.** 독립 승인·Issue #5 종결·운영 apply/엔진 전환과 분리합니다.","created_at":"2026-09-17T02:04:47Z","updated_at":"2026-09-17T02:09:39Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"441e91c72504c48fc1fedf4a10ff0d8fd6a221fd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/pulls/21/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/pulls/21/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/issues/21/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/321Team/infra-ansible/statuses/c50a6b3316fabba08d5211933e3733f8026e2d95","head":{"label":"321Team:test/issue-5-isolated-negative-20260917","ref":"test/issue-5-isolated-negative-20260917","sha":"c50a6b3316fabba08d5211933e3733f8026e2d95","user":{"login":"321Team","id":315682664,"node_id":"O_kgDOEtDvaA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/315682664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/321Team","html_url":"https://github.com/321Team","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/321Team/followers","fo